<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        THIS COMMENT SITS INSIDE THE ROOT ELEMENT DELIBERATELY - see Primary_LOI__c
        .field-meta.xml in this folder for the full reasoning behind this field group.

        ADDED 2026-08-25. One of NINE formula fields mirroring the primary LOI / primary PSA
        onto Disposition__c, shaped on the five NDA_*__c fields already here.

        THE PRICE THE DEAL LANDED ON, not the price it opened on. LOI__c also carries Offer_Price__c
        and Counter_Price__c; Final_Agreed_Price__c is the one that is blank until both sides
        have actually agreed, which is exactly why a blank here must not read as zero.

        🔴 formulaTreatBlanksAs = BlankAsBlank, NOT the BlankAsZero the neighbouring
        Net_Sale_Proceeds__c uses, AND THE DIFFERENCE IS LOAD-BEARING. Net_Sale_Proceeds__c
        SUBTRACTS two fields and genuinely wants a missing cost to count as zero. This field is
        a bare cross-object reference: with BlankAsZero a disposition with no primary LOI would
        render a confident $0.00 where the honest answer is "no LOI yet", and $0.00 on a price
        field is a statement about the deal, not about the data. Blank is the only correct
        rendering for every pre-LOI stage, which is most of them.

        precision 18 / scale 2 match the source field on LOI__c exactly - a narrower scale here
        would silently round a real price.

        🔴 FLS: read-only in BOTH DPEG_Disposition_Edit and DPEG_Disposition_View - a formula
        field cannot carry editable = true (hard deploy error). Invisible to everyone, admins
        included, until those permission sets land with this file.
    -->
    <fullName>LOI_Final_Agreed_Price__c</fullName>
    <description>The primary LOI's Final_Agreed_Price__c, read through Primary_LOI__c. Blank before a primary LOI exists or before a price is agreed.</description>
    <externalId>false</externalId>
    <formula>Primary_LOI__r.Final_Agreed_Price__c</formula>
    <formulaTreatBlanksAs>BlankAsBlank</formulaTreatBlanksAs>
    <inlineHelpText>The agreed price on the primary LOI. Blank until both sides agree. Read-only; derived.</inlineHelpText>
    <label>LOI Final Agreed Price</label>
    <precision>18</precision>
    <required>false</required>
    <scale>2</scale>
    <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
    <type>Currency</type>
</CustomField>
